  "selection_policy": {
    "_comment": "匹配与排序策略（可调，属于协调层）。primary 会被硬门禁强制加载；supporting 仅作建议。routing_skills 是纯编排入口（加载后自身即为流程），不作为专业执行者被选中。一个能力只取最强的一个 primary（per_capability_primary），避免同质技能并列；阶段总量再受 max_stage_primary 约束。",
    "max_primary": 3,
    "max_supporting": 4,
    "max_stage_primary": 4,
    "per_capability_primary": 1,
    "min_score": 3.0,
    "name_weight": 3.0,
    "description_weight": 1.0,
    "stage_weight": 1.5,
    "require_name_or_description_hit": true,
    "exclude_disabled_skills": true,
    "routing_skills": [
      "mathematical-modeling",
      "mm-iteration-engine"
    ]
  },
  "_changelog": "1.1.0: 补英文关键词（manuscript/draft/restructure/polishing/search/plotting 等）。原词表几乎只有中文词，导致 nature-* 等英文 description 的 skill 匹配分低于 min_score 被过滤——用户装了 skill 却从不被选中。"
